      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RANGER RIOT (1) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into third last time out (25.93) over 450m at Warrnambool. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. GRAVY TRAIN (5) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Trimbole (26.35) in a Mix 6/7. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Can measure up. INDIAN CHIEF (2) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at Horsham over 485m behind Claressa (28.69) in a Maiden. Better than last start and can bounce back. DOONGALLA GLORY (8) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
